The recommended way in den: keep the host on stable, and pull the unstable package set in as an attribute of `pkgs` via an overlay — so you reference `pkgs.unstable.<pkg>` for the few packages you want. This is what den's docs recommend for exactly this case ("most flakes want the host on stable and a few packages from unstable"):

