{"answer":"It goes on **tux's aspect, with an explicit edge to `igloo`** — den has no "per-host" sub-key on user aspects, the scoping is done by naming the host:

```nix
# modules/tux.nix — user config that lands only on igloo
{
  den.aspects.tux = {
    provides.igloo.homeManager = { pkgs, ... }: {
      home.packages = [ pkgs.something ];
      # ...only this reaches tux on igloo, nobody else
    };
  };
