Each host in `den.hosts` is instantiated by the pipeline and placed at `flake.nixosConfigurations.<name>` (or `darwinConfigurations` / `homeConfigurations` for homes) by default — you can override the path with `host.intoAttr` or skip placement with `intoAttr = [ ]`. The whole top-level set lands in `config.flake`, so your `flake.nix` is just:

```nix
