How I know: I read this in NixOS/nixpkgs at `nixos-unstable` — `nixos/modules/virtualisation/build-vm.nix` (defines `virtualisation.vmVariant` and sets `system.build.vm = lib.mkDefault config.virtualisation.vmVariant.system.build.vm`; the `vmVariant` module type is `extendModules { modules = [ ./qemu-vm.nix ]; }`), `nixos/modules/virtualisation/qemu-vm.nix` (`system.build.vm` is a `runCommand` that symlinks the extended config's `system.build.toplevel`, and declares the `virtualisation.*` VM options), and `lib/modules.nix` (`mkVMOverride = mkOverride 10`).

