     inputs = { ... };
     outputs = { self, ... }:
       lib.genAttrs self.systems (system: {
         packages = { ... };
         # etc.
       });
   }
   ```

   (declare `systems = [ "x86_64-linux" ... ];` in flake.nix, or use flake-utils' `eachSystem`). Then people access `packages.x86_64-linux.foo` and the system is passed to you as a normal argument.
